	(text "GS: RP-GS (RP2350B-MINI-A) + PCM5102 + microSD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 73.66 65.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e6e68e5-396c-59c2-91f5-368b8ebf6e89")
	)
	(text "D1: anode - digital +5V of the board, cathode - module 5V (its USB-C VBUS is tied to 5V).\n3V3_GS: module LDO output - SD card supply and pull-ups.\nPins may be reassigned at PCB layout; firmware pins are variables (config.h)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 181.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7b261a43-6320-57ef-8c24-cb03390524e5")
	)
	(text "CPLD firmware without a blaster: RP-GS plays an SVF file (Quartus -> SVF) on JTAG_* from SD or USB.\n1k TCK pull-down per MAX3000A datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 199.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7ced09e9-7666-578d-87df-85fd52c58702")
	)
	(text "Module jumpers: SCK->GND, FLT/DEMP/FMT->L; XSMT jumper OPEN (driven by RP-GS).\n10k DNP: XSMT pull-down - muted until RP-GS is up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b5c8c84b-ebd3-5780-a360-5f81ee653049")
	)
